WEBVTT

00:00:03.205 --> 00:00:07.656
Open Artificial Intelligence, Profiles, and click Add Profile.

00:00:07.656 --> 00:00:12.305
Choose where to start, and enter a Title, such as Research agent.

00:00:12.755 --> 00:00:14.734
Set Profile type to Agent.

00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:16.835
Now the Description matters.

00:00:16.835 --> 00:00:21.286
Other assistants read it to decide when to call this agent, so say

00:00:21.286 --> 00:00:22.955
exactly what it does.

00:00:23.407 --> 00:00:26.807
Availability is On demand, or Always available.

00:00:26.807 --> 00:00:30.976
On demand includes the agent only when the request fits it.

00:00:30.976 --> 00:00:35.467
Always available includes it in every request, which costs more.

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:36.557
Click Save.

